## 1. Expected Layer Naming (from binary strings)

Colibri's C-loader expects the following tensor key patterns:

### Transformer Layers (model.layers.%d.*)

  model.layers.%d.input_layernorm.weight
  model.layers.%d.post_attention_layernorm.weight
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.q_a_layernorm.weight
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.kv_a_layernorm.weight
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.kv_a_proj_with_mqa.weight  ← MLA with MQA (MQA merged)
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.q_a_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.q_b_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.kv_b_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.o_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.indexer.k_norm.weight      ← GLM deepseek_sparse attention
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.indexer.k_norm.bias
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.indexer.weights_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.indexer.wk.weight
  model.layers.%d.self_attn.indexer.wq_b.weight
  model.layers.%d.mlp.gate.weight
  model.layers.%d.mlp.gate_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.mlp.up_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.mlp.down_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.mlp.experts.%d.gate_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.mlp.experts.%d.up_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.mlp.experts.%d.down_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.mlp.shared_experts.gate_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.mlp.shared_experts.up_proj.weight
  model.layers.%d.mlp.shared_experts.down_proj.weight

### Output Layers

  model.layers.%d.enorm.weight          ← GLM MTP final norm (NOT standard transformer norm)
  model.layers.%d.hnorm.weight            ← GLM MTP head norm
  model.layers.%d.shared_head.norm.weight ← shared head norm
  model.norm.weight                       ← final model output norm
  model.embed_tokens.weight               ← embedding
  lm_head.weight                          ← output projection

### Gate/Router (GLM-specific)

  model.layers.%d.mlp.gate.e_score_correction_bias  ← GLM gating with score correction

