## 5. Verdict

### RECOMMENDED: GLM-5.3-Flash (with remap) ✅

Reasons:
1. ALL tensor names COMPATIBLE after zero-copy index remap
   (model.language_model.* → model.* prefix strip)
2. GLM MTP enorm/hnorm: EXACT MATCH with binary
3. MLA attention tensors (kv_a_layernorm, kv_a_proj_with_mqa): EXACT MATCH
4. Gate with e_score_correction_bias: EXACT MATCH (only GLM has this)
5. Shared + routed experts: EXACT MATCH
6. Expert count (288) is dynamic — binary handles whatever config says
7. Only difference: GLM-5.3 has 288 experts vs 64 in GLM-5.2 — should still work

### DeepSeek-V2.5: NOT RECOMMENDED ❌

Reasons:
1. deepseek_v4 engine defined in source but NOT compiled into binary
2. Missing GLM-specific e_score_correction_bias gate tensor
3. DeepSeekMoE routing differs from GLM's gating — would need deepseek_v4 engine

